  /**
   * Merges all the fields of the provided Obj into this instance, producing a new Obj of the same type as this one.
   * In case of conflicts, fields of other instance take precedence, and if dontAllowOverride is true result in an error.
   *
   * If fields are not the same and doNotConvert is true, or if values are not convertible, an error is thrown.
   * If fields exist in both objects and dontAllowOverride is true, an error is thrown.
   *
   * @param other
   *           object
   * @param doNotAllowOverride
   *           if true, throw an error if a non-null field value being merged already exists
   * @param doNotConvert
   *           if true, don't attempt to convert fields to the correct value type
   * @return the new merged Obj
   */
  // TODO: PLAT-42535
  // mergeObj: inline member function(other: !?Obj, doNotAllowOverride: boolean, doNotConvert: boolean): !mixing Obj

  /**
   * Merges all the fields of the provided Obj into this instance, producing a new Obj of the same type as this one.
   * In case of conflicts, fields of other instance take precedence unless otherwise specified by the fieldPathMergeSpec
   *
   * @param other
   *           object
   * @param fieldPathMergeSpec
   *           mapping of fields of the object to the respective merge annotations
   * @return the new merged Obj
   */
